      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Physics｜结构图\n物理材质只提供表面语义。[[Physics/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPhysicalMaterialWithTags\n继承 UPhysicalMaterial。\n`Tags: FGameplayTagContainer` → 标记 Metal/Flesh 等表面类型。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FHitResult.PhysMaterial\n近战或其他碰撞结果携带材质资产；普通材质没有项目 Tags。[[Combat/结构]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility / GE\n`ApplyAbilityTagsToGameplayEffectSpec()` 可把材质 Tag 并入目标捕获 Tag。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## DamageExecution / HitImpact Cue\n按表面 Tag 选择衰减或表现；具体规则属于 [[AbilitySystem/结构]]。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
